\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. There is no goodness on earth;\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And therefore let all
\par Take the path that's heavenward,
\par Whereby we shall have
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Eternal life
\par We shall not feel happy here
\par Heaven is our right abode,
\par Let us go there!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Heavenward your direction,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Where the Lord God is.
\par As for treasuries of this world,
\par Worry not yourself!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Heaven's treasures
\par Ever safe from theft and spoil,
\par Shall be made to fill your soul,
\par Eternally.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  If you are melancholic,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Look up to heaven;
\par For your Father in heaven
\par Cares for you in love.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What's your problem?
\par Heaven of great happiness;
\par Void of darkness, full of light;
\par Be of good cheer.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Your Savour is in heaven,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 It was through disdain
\par And great sorrow that He went;
\par You too, follow Him!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par With great patience
\par Shall you follow your good Lord;
\par And be humble like he was:
\par to victory fight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Heaven's path passes through death
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Frightening thou this is,
\par  It does also lead to life,
\par  Jesus follows suit.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Be calm, be calm !
\par For after this night of gloom,
\par Daylight shall appear for you.
\par And make you pleased.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  May you be well satisfied;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In heaven you'll find
\par Your great Saviour who shall give
\par You a warm embrace
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Of reception
\par Great happiness you shall find;
\par Glory, great contentment and
\par Eternal life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  This is how pains of this world
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Shall end finally;
\par Be of thanks to your Saviour,
\par But not an ingrate!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Praise Him always;
\par Let us all uplift His name
\par Until it gets to heaven,
\par Hallelujah!
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

